            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<h1>Online Multiplayer!</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>We are back! And we brought you new features!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After 10 years, we are back with a new team...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With us we bring you a very awaited update!</p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/412410/extras/a526974c29c8db8bed276214917ea8fe.avif?t=1790235134\" width=640 height=256 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLAYER CHAOS! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Castle Chaos is a fast paced multiplayer game up to 4 players inspired by the old classic game &quot;Rampart&quot;. Build castles with Tetris-like shapes and shoot cannons to destroy your opponents' castles. Available for PC, Mac and Linux.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/412410/extras/c7cb52e33b6ba044cdd66ce87e3c2734.avif?t=1790235134\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Random generated maps depending on number of players </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Lots of settings to customize your matches, from nr of castles, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >cannons to bushes and cloud density</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Choose to play against human or AI opponents or mix</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Many different puzzle shapes to drive you crazy when building your castles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Annoying gnomes planting bushes everywhere, but thankfully shootable</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play as a gnome! Repair your castle while trying to avoid your </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >opponents' suspicions by acting gnome-like. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play on gamepad, keyboard or all on the same keyboard for extra chaotic fun with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/412410/extras/e3c7085a1a57447474e1240350cfb53f.avif?t=1790235134\" width=153 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our discord and talk to the developers directly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/412410/extras/608010e837860ed7a41d951623c073a7.avif?t=1790235134\" width=128 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ASSETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fonts</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alagard font by Hewett Tsoi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/412410/extras/a526974c29c8db8bed276214917ea8fe.avif?t=1790235134\" width=640 height=256 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLAYER CHAOS! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Castle Chaos is a fast paced multiplayer game up to 4 players inspired by the old classic game &quot;Rampart&quot;. Build castles with Tetris-like shapes and shoot cannons to destroy your opponents' castles. Available for PC, Mac and Linux.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/412410/extras/c7cb52e33b6ba044cdd66ce87e3c2734.avif?t=1790235134\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Random generated maps depending on number of players </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Lots of settings to customize your matches, from nr of castles, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >cannons to bushes and cloud density</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Choose to play against human or AI opponents or mix</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Many different puzzle shapes to drive you crazy when building your castles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Annoying gnomes planting bushes everywhere, but thankfully shootable</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play as a gnome! Repair your castle while trying to avoid your </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >opponents' suspicions by acting gnome-like. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play on gamepad, keyboard or all on the same keyboard for extra chaotic fun with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/412410/extras/e3c7085a1a57447474e1240350cfb53f.avif?t=1790235134\" width=153 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our discord and talk to the developers directly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/412410/extras/608010e837860ed7a41d951623c073a7.avif?t=1790235134\" width=128 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ASSETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fonts</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alagard font by Hewett Tsoi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
            "short_description": "Castle Chaos is a fast paced multiplayer game for up to 4 players inspired by the old classic game &quot;Rampart&quot;. Build castles with tetris-like shapes and shoot cannons to destroy your opponents' castles. Available for PC, Mac and Linux.",
